flowchart TB
  subgraph current[Implemented prototype — local Kubernetes plus hosted CI]
    developer[Developer + workload YAML] --> cli[aiplatform CLI]
    cli --> helm[Helm on local kind]
    cli --> git[Git desired state]
    git --> argo[Argo CD on kind]
    argo --> pods[Inference pods]
    helm --> pods
    github[GitHub Actions] --> checks[Tests + Terraform validation + policies]
    github --> ghcr[GHCR image registry]
    ghcr --> pods
    ingress[ingress-nginx] --> pods
    pods --> cache[PVC model cache]
    pods --> metrics[Prometheus + Grafana]
    pods --> traces[OTel Collector + Jaeger]
  end
  subgraph midpoint[Proposed AWS midpoint footprint — deployment pending]
    client[Operator IP] --> sg[Restricted security group]
    sg --> ec2[EC2 inference container in public subnet]
    ec2 --> ebs[Encrypted EBS model cache]
    ghcr -. image pull .-> ec2
    igw[Internet gateway + route table] --- ec2
  end
  subgraph later[Later AWS target — not deployed]
    eks[EKS workers + Argo CD + observability]
    ecr[ECR images] --> eks
    s3[S3 Terraform state]
    alb[ALB ingress] --> eks
    gpu[Optional GPU inference nodes] --- eks
  end
